\" class=\\"h-full min-w-0 flex-1 bg-transparent px-3.5 text-paper placeholder:text-muted-light focus-visible:outline-none font-mono text-sm\\" placeholder=\\"claude-desktop, cursor, chatgpt…\\" required=\\"\\" autoComplete=\\"off\\" spellCheck=\\"false\\" value=\\"\\"/></div><p id=\\"_R_-note\\" class=\\"mt-1.5 min-h-5 text-sm text-muted\\">Only for you, to tell the keys apart.</p></div><div class=\\"\\"><label for=\\"_R_\\" class=\\"text-sm font-medium\\">Valid for (days)</label><div class=\\"rounded-lg border border-line-strong bg-ink text-paper caret-lime transition-colors duration-200 hover:border-paper/30 focus-within:border-paper/50 has-aria-invalid:border-amber-400/70 mt-1.5 flex h-11 items-center\\"><input id=\\"_R_\\" aria-describedby=\\"_R_-note\\" class=\\"h-full min-w-0 flex-1 bg-transparent px-3.5 text-paper placeholder:text-muted-light focus-visible:outline-none \\" type=\\"number\\" min=\\"1\\" max=\\"30\\" value=\\"30\\"/></div><p id=\\"_R_-note\\" class=\\"mt-1.5 min-h-5 text-sm text-muted\\">Up to 30 days.</p></div><button type=\\"submit\\" class=\\"relative inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full font-medium whitespace-nowrap pointer-coarse:after:absolute pointer-coarse:after:top-1/2 pointer-coarse:after:left-1/2 pointer-coarse:after:size-full pointer-coarse:after:min-h-11 pointer-coarse:after:min-w-11 pointer-coarse:after:-translate-x-1/2 pointer-coarse:after:-translate-y-1/2 transition-[background-color,border-color,color,opacity,transform] duration-150 active:scale-[0.96] bg-paper text-ink hover:bg-white focus-visible:bg-white disabled:opacity-60 h-11 px-6 text-sm w-full\\"><svg aria-hidden=\\"true\\" viewBox=\\"0 0 24 24\\" class=\\"shrink-0 size-4\\" fill=\\"none\\" stroke=\\"currentColor\\" stroke-width=\\"1.6\\" stroke-linecap=\\"round\\" stroke-linejoin=\\"round\\"><path d=\\"M8.5 11.5a4 4 0 1 0 0 8 4 4 0 0 0 0-8zM11.3 12.7L20 4M16.5 7.5L19 10M14 10l2 2M7 15.5h.01\\"></path></svg>Create access key</button><p class=\\"mt-4 text-[0.8125rem] leading-snug text-pretty text-muted\\">A new key starts with every skill off, and follows each connector&#x27;s default unless that connector makes new keys start off.</p></form><section aria-labelledby=\\"keys-title\\" class=\\"vignette-top rounded-xl border border-line-strong bg-ink-raised p-5\\"><div class=\\"mb-3 flex items-baseline gap-3\\"><h2 id=\\"keys-title\\" class=\\"text-base leading-snug font-medium text-paper\\">Access keys</h2><span class=\\"inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1.5 font-mono text-xs leading-5 text-muted \\">1</span></div><ul class=\\"@container -mx-5 mt-3 border-t border-line\\"><li data-row=\\"stay\\" class=\\"border-b border-line px-4 py-3 transition-opacity duration-250 last:border-b-0 sm:px-5 \\"><div class=\\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-1\\"><span class=\\"size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-lime\\" aria-hidden=\\"true\\"></span><code title=\\"laptop\\" class=\\"min-w-0 grow basis-[calc(100%-1.5rem)] truncate font-mono text-sm font-medium @md:basis-0\\" translate=\\"no\\">laptop</code><span class=\\"font-mono text-xs text-muted @max-md:ml-5.5 @max-md:min-w-0 @max-md:grow @max-md:basis-0\\">until Jan 1, 2999, 12:00 AM</span><button type=\\"button\\" aria-label=\\"Revoke the key laptop\\" class=\\"relative inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full font-medium whitespace-nowrap pointer-coarse:after:absolute pointer-coarse:after:top-1/2 pointer-coarse:after:left-1/2 pointer-coarse:after:size-full pointer-coarse:after:min-h-11 pointer-coarse:after:min-w-11 pointer-coarse:after:-translate-x-1/2 pointer-coarse:after:-translate-y-1/2 transition-[background-color,border-color,color,opacity,transform] duration-150 active:scale-[0.96] border border-amber-400/40 text-amber-400 hover:border-amber-400 focus-visible:border-amber-400 disabled:opacity-50 h-8 px-3 text-xs\\">Revoke</button></div><div class=\\"-mx-4 mt-1 sm:-mx-5\\"><button type=\\"button\\" aria-expanded=\\"false\\" aria-controls=\\"_R_\\" class=\\"flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center gap-3 px-4 py-2.5 text-left text-sm select-none pointer-coarse:min-h-11\\"><span class=\\"flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-x-3 gap-y-0.5\\"><span class=\\"text-sm text-muted\\">Connectors</span><span class=\\"font-mono text-xs text-muted\\">1 · 0 custom · 0 off</span></span><svg aria-hidden=\\"true\\" viewBox=\\"0 0 24 24\\" class=\\"shrink-0 size-4 text-muted transition-transform duration-250 ease-(--ease-glide) \\" fill=\\"none\\" stroke=\\"currentColor\\" stroke-width=\\"1.6\\" stroke-linecap=\\"round\\" stroke-linejoin=\\"round\\"><path d=\\"M6.5 9.5l5.5 5.5 5.5-5.5\\"></path></svg></button><div id=\\"_R_\\" inert=\\"\\" class=\\"grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-250 ease-(--ease-glide) grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0\\"><div class=\\"min-h-0 overflow-hidden\\"><ul class=\\"px-4 pb-2 sm:px-5\\"><li class=\\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3 py-1.5\\"><a href=\\"/connectors/c1?profile=laptop\\" class=\\"cursor-pointer underline decoration-line-strong underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-paper hover:decoration-paper min-w-0 truncate text-sm\\">Gmail</a><span class=\\"inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1.5 font-mono text-xs leading-5 text-muted \\">Follow default</span></li></ul></div></div></div></li></ul></section></div></section></section></div></div></main></div></div>"
