tifications\\" class=\\"cursor-pointer underline decoration-line-strong underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-paper hover:decoration-paper mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-muted\\">Notification settings<svg aria-hidden=\\"true\\" viewBox=\\"0 0 16 16\\" class=\\"inline-block size-4 shrink-0 \\" fill=\\"none\\" stroke=\\"currentColor\\" stroke-width=\\"1.5\\" stroke-linecap=\\"round\\" stroke-linejoin=\\"round\\"><path d=\\"M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4\\"></path></svg></a></section></aside></div></section></div></div></main></div></div>"
